OL,3,GNEWSAInquests open into A66 crash
OL,4,Apolice deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Fpeople may find upsetting
OL,9,FInquests have opened into the deaths of
OL,10,Ftwo police officers who were killed in
OL,11,Fa crash on the A66.
OL,13,FCleveland Police officers PC Matthew
OL,14,FBlades, 37, and PC Tom Clough, 38, died
OL,15,Fon Saturday when their police vehicle
OL,16,Fwas hit by a Volkswagen Passat which
OL,17,Fwas going the wrong way down the dual
OL,18,Fcarriageway near Middlesbrough.
OL,20,FArea Coroner for Teesside and
OL,21,FHartlepool Paul Appleton opened the
OL,22,Finquests at Teesside Coroner's Court.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
